  m_Name: Alien_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueEventSO
  dialogueID: Alien_Intro
  conversation:
  - Hi!
  - I haven't seen you around...
  - Welcome to our planet!
  - What? You crash landed?!
  - Of course I could help you get your ship piece back.
  - I have a favor to ask in return.
  - I can't go into the forrest, I'd accidently burn the place to the ground!
  - Could you get me a golden apple?
  - All you have to do is plant some trees. There's a chance one of the fruit will
    be extra special!
  - Then, I'll help you get your peice so you could go home! Deal?
  seen: 0
